## Model card

- **Name:** NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL 120B A12B (NVFP4)
- **Short description:** NVIDIA’s open-weight vision-language Mixture-of-Experts model (Mamba-Transformer hybrid) for multimodal and video-centric agent workflows.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B-NVFP4`, OpenMDW-1.1 license per metadata/card context) and hosted providers. Local metadata lists `opencode/nemotron-3.5-super-vl` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Hugging Face model card reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B-NVFP4`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 native context (host-served context may vary, e.g. 262,144 per local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and video input; text output (vision-language model).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Open weights available for self-hosting (license as stated on HF); hosted pricing varies by provider (local metadata cites NanoGPT $0.15/$0.50 per 1M, cache $0.02).
- **Architecture:** Hybrid Mamba-Transformer MoE, 120B total / 12B active parameters (per local metadata/card naming); NVFP4 quantized release.

